This product redistributes prebuilt WebAssembly binaries from third-party
open-source projects. Binaries are vendored with SHA-256 pins that are
verified at build time (scripts/fetch-grammars.mjs).

1. Tree-sitter core runtime — resources/tree-sitter.wasm
   Redistributed via the `web-tree-sitter` npm package.
   Copyright (c) Max Brunsfeld and tree-sitter contributors.
   Licensed under the MIT License.
   Upstream: https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter
   Package:  https://www.npmjs.com/package/web-tree-sitter

2. Tree-sitter grammar binaries — resources/grammars/*.wasm
   Prebuilt artifacts redistributed via the `tree-sitter-wasms` npm package
   (public-domain aggregation of prebuilt grammars). Each grammar is an
   independently licensed work of its respective authors and contributors,
   under the MIT License unless noted in its upstream repository:

   - tree-sitter-rust        — https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-rust
   - tree-sitter-go          — https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-go
   - tree-sitter-python      — https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-python
   - tree-sitter-typescript  — https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-typescript
                              (this build also provides tsx support)
   - tree-sitter-tsx         — https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-typescript
   - tree-sitter-solidity    — https://github.com/JoranDirksen/tree-sitter-solidity

   Full license texts and copyright statements are maintained in the
   upstream repositories linked above.
